+    Setting<StringSet> untrustedImpureEnvNames{
+        this,
+        {},
+        "untrusted-impure-env-names",
+        R"(
+          Names of environment variables that a client which isn't trusted
+          may set through [`impure-env`](#conf-impure-env). The daemon keeps
+          a client's entry for a name listed here and drops any other, naming
+          the variable but never its value.
+
+          A name set this way reaches only a fixed-output derivation that
+          lists it in `impureEnvVars`, and such a derivation's output is
+          checked against its hash, so a client can give only its own builds
+          its own credentials, as a trusted client can, without being
+          trusted with the rest of the daemon.
+        )"};
